*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd  binary
*.tga  binary
*.exr  binary
*.hdr  binary
*.fbx  binary
*.blend binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.dll  binary
*.so   binary
